CITY CONTRACT NO. 2985
AMENDMENT NO. 5 TO CITY CONTRACT NO. 2985
BETWEEN THE CITY OF CHEYENNEg AND THE CITY OF CHEYENNE
LARAMIE COUNTY JOINT POWERS BOARD
1.
Parties. The parties to this Amendment No. 5 are the City of Cheyenne, a municipal
corporation duly organized and existing under the laws of the State of Wyoming, whose principal
address is 2101 O’NeiI Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001 (“City”), and the City of Cheyenne
Laramie County Joint Powers Board, a statutorily authorized entity organized and existing under
the laws of the State of Wyoming, whose address is P.O. Box 2477, Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
(“JPB”).
2.
Purpose of Amendment.
The purpose of this Amendment No. 5 is to amend
Paragraph 1, Leased Area, ofthe original Lease between the parties dated March 9, 1992, to include
the following described real property located in Frontier Park:
Lots 2, 3, and 4 of Frontier Park, a subdivision to the City of Cheyenne, consisting
of 3.78 acres, situated in portions of Government Lots 1 and 2, NE 1/4 NE 1/4, and
the SE 1/4 NE 1/4 of Section 25, Township 14 North. Range 67 West, of the 6th
P.M., City of Cheyenne, Laramie County, Wyoming.
3.
Other Terms and Conditions Remain Unchanged. All other terms and conditions of
the original Lease and Amendments thereto remain unchanged and in full force and effect.
4.
Signatures. In witness whereof, the parties to this Amendment No. 5, through their
duly authorized representatives, have executed this Amendment No. 5 on the dates set out below and
certify that they have read, understood and agreed to the terms and conditions of this Amendment
No.5.
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING
Date
Marian J. Orr, Mayor
(SEAL)
Attest:
Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk
CITY OF CHEYENNE-LARAMIE COUNTY
JOINT POWERS BOARD
